{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1421526001:1":{"text":"Vaun, how's it going?","source_cn":"瓦恩，我们来看看你的进展！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C581543EE3958DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421526002:1":{"text":"Wow, this blade looks so sharp! Chippy can't believe it's made from that scrap. It's already perfect!","source_cn":"哇，好锋利的宝剑！真想不到这是那块材料锻出来的剑！满满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689E2291B9FEC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421526003:1":{"text":"But I still see room for improvement...","source_cn":"可我觉得还不够……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF406665710AF1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1421526003":{"text":"But I still see room for improvement...","source_cn":"可我觉得还不够……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF406665710AF1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421526004:1":{"text":"Hear that? The magister and Chippy are on the same page! You can trust our judgment!","source_cn":"看！主人都发话啦！满满和主人两个人的判断肯定没问题！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x761261F4CE487BD1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hear that? The magister and Chippy are on the same page! You can trust our judgment!","female":"Hear that? The magister and Chippy are on the same page! You can trust our judgment!","variant_male_record_index":"165105","variant_female_record_index":"165106","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421526005:1":{"text":"Alright... guess I'll stop here.","source_cn":"好吧……那我就停手了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCC7FC1403C31D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421526006:1":{"text":"Time's up anyway! The first round of the elimination stage is officially over!","source_cn":"再不舍得停手也该停啦！淘汰赛第一阶段正式结束！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B87E9B62D6FC34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421526007:1":{"text":"Let me see this blade... Not bad! You nailed it!","source_cn":"我来看看这把剑胚……不错，看来你们领悟了主办方的苦心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC58080C87D7A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421526008:1":{"text":"It's a pass for Vaun!","source_cn":"我宣布，瓦恩正式通过第一阶段的考验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x294418F4DEA0DE56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421526009:1":{"text":"See these wooded pieces? They are the materials for the next round.","source_cn":"下面，我将发放下一阶段的材料——也就是这些木料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8876224625F86C1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"Scrap Wood","source_cn":"破烂木材","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD0B64B8DBB9864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421526010:1":{"text":"You must use these to craft the hilt for your sword. After the first round, I'm sure all of you have got the hang of things.","source_cn":"参赛者需要使用主办方提供的木料制作并安装剑柄。相信你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E58DFB04AA78B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421526011:0":{"text":"The wood... looks pretty rough and far from sturdy...","source_cn":"看起来破破烂烂的……木质很疏松呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FCB6D647BA34E73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421526012:0":{"text":"Please carry on with your work. Once you're done, you can head back to the competition site to submit your sword. Good luck! I'm rooting for you!","source_cn":"那么请继续准备比赛吧。剑柄安装完成后，请前往参赛场地提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7326DE6997442656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421526013:0":{"text":"With the experience from the first round, Chippy thinks this round is all about digging for diamonds in the rough... Right?","source_cn":"有了上一次的经验，这次又是在考验我们能不能从这些木料中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80CE78B761715D92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421526014:1":{"text":"Yes. This type of wood has a porous outer layer but an incredibly sturdy core. Let me try removing the outer part...","source_cn":"的确，这种铁藜木虽然边材疏松，但心材却格外坚硬，我试着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DA5AA10AC1A413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"It's already flawless.","source_cn":"已经完美无缺了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x622B0A70FC7DDDCF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's already flawless.","female":"It's already flawless.","variant_male_record_index":"72974","variant_female_record_index":"72975","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦恩":{"text":"Vaun","source":"瓦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大赛员工拉齐":{"text":"Lacy","source":"大赛员工拉齐","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":4}}